WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:28.600
What did you say?!

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.270
Domon Kasshu hasn't gone to the
site of the Final Round yet?!

00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:32.440
No.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:35.740
And I haven't been able to get
any details from my daughter yet.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.110
This is crazy!

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:40.200
The Final Round commences
in only three days!

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.950
Please. Do not worry.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.200
I'm confident he'll be
there in time.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.160
Can you be so sure?!

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.290
Well, of course.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.750
He understands that...

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.250
...he must make it to
the Final Round...

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.710
...doing what he can
to save his father.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.960
But still...

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:57.720
Reporting...!

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:00.720
G reactor levels on Earth
increasing rapidly!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.680
Gundams everywhere
are on the move!

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:03.550
Okay!

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:11.150
Neo Canada
Lumber Gundam

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.570
Neo Greece
Zeus Gundam

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:28.790
Neo Holland
Nether Gundam

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.760
Neo Spain
Matador Gundam

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.720
Neo Norway
Viking Gundam

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:42.890
Now...

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:48.060
It seems the Gundams that have
survived these past 11 months...

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.980
...are now finally making
their grand appearance.

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:55.400
And they're all headed to the site
of the 13th Gundam Fight Finals...

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.440
...in Neo Hong Kong.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.030
The Final Battle's
in only three days.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.240
Will Domon and those with the
insignia of the Shuffle Alliance...

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.910
...make it there in time?

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.030
And now!

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:10.160
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:16.170
The Final Battle Approaches!
Only 3 Days Away

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:38.780
Is that right?

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:43.320
So they sent their crewmembers
ahead and remained here?

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:48.490
Then you will also go ahead
and leave for Neo Hong Kong?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:50.410
Good.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.500
I still have unfinished
business here.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.590
Stabilizer, mark.
Power balance system okay.

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:02.800
Open gauge,
clearance 0, plus 2.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.010
Transformation system stable.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.100
Good!

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.470
Mademoiselle Rain!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.390
I assumed you'd be on your way
to Neo Hong Kong by this time.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:13.640
Don't look!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:18.690
That's low of you to peek at a rival
Gundam while it's under repair!

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.530
Oh, please excuse me!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.780
I assure you, I'm here because
I need to see Domon Kasshu.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:24.400
He's not around.

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.160
What do you mean he's not here?

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.120
Well, uh...

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.080
Where are you heading?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.540
I'm going off somewhere to
be alone to complete my training.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.670
But there's no time left before
the Finals begin.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.170
Don't worry.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.550
I'll be back before then.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.300
When I return...

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:49.300
...I'll demonstrate to you that
I'm capable of using this sword.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.560
Those were his last words before
he disappeared two weeks ago.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.270
He left two weeks ago?

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.100
Is that right?

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.360
Everyone, it's as you heard.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.070
Why don't you people come out
now and show yourselves?

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:08.990
So, you knew.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.200
I know you're here too,
Chibodee Crocket.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.410
And let's not forget
the two from Neo Russia.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.130
We must have all been
thinking the same thing.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:20.840
Yes.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:22.630
Then shall we do it?!

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:23.880
Okay!

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.680
Wh-what are you planning to do,
you guys?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.510
Just sit back and watch!

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.520
These are the ones we have to
beat at Neo Hong Kong, after all.

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:35.930
Yeah.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:38.810
I would've liked it better if
we had Bro here with us, though.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:44.900
What's wrong?

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.070
It's starting to hurt again.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.490
Mine, too.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.370
Then...

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:54.830
...I'm not the only one who's
been feeling this pain.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.500
And you too, huh?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:05:59.670
Yes.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.500
It began two weeks ago,
when Domon Kasshu disappeared.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:03.750
What?

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.420
Could something have
happened to him?

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.590
No. Not likely in his case.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:09.760
If that's so...

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.840
...don't you think...

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:15.520
...maybe we're feeling the pain
he's feeling at this very moment?

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:16.850
Yeah.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.230
A strange feeling,
not really suffering or anxiety.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.440
Maybe we're connected to each
other through the crests, after all.

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.690
As the Shuffle Alliance.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.780
Nonsense!

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.860
Have you guys decided to get
all friendly all of a sudden?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.980
Forget this Shuffle Alliance.

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:33.780
Listen.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:38.370
You're Gundam Fighters who
fight for your nation's honor.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.250
You're enemies of one other.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.040
Yet you gather here to
take part in a farce?

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.050
If you won't fight,
I'm just wasting my time!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:47.800
Let's go, Argo!

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.550
It's true we're meant
to be enemies.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.390
However...

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.060
...this pain we're experiencing
is also very genuine.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.730
What could be happening
with Domon?

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.560
Not yet!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:05.730
How did I activate the Super
Mode without feeling anger?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.820
When I fought against
that phony Master Gundam...

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:13.780
...and...

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.530
...all that power during
the bout with Chibodee.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.330
And when I stopped George
as he went out of control.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:25.380
What leads me
to the Super Mode?!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:34.340
And why do I keep seeing
these images of Master?!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.890
Is that the extent of your ability?

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.560
You make me laugh!

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:46.480
There's no way you're going to
be able to save your father!

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.110
Father!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.990
Come on, do you think you can
really defeat me?!

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.450
If you think you can, give it a try!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.460
I-I...

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.160
I didn't realize Domon had this
much difficulty with his training.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:11.510
In which case, I've got no choice.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.350
It's setting, it's setting.
The sun is setting.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.220
Now there's only two more days
until the Finals.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:24.850
Man, what're we
sticking around here for?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:25.690
Tell me.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.690
I don't know about you,
but I have a good reason.

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.900
Yeah? And what's that?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.650
Well, this is an uncivilized land.
And lots of animals.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.620
With Domon not around, it is
my duty to protect the lady.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.160
Yet another duty of a knight.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:41.870
Oh?

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:44.080
You sure that's the reason?

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:47.540
Aren't we all here
for the same thing?

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.960
What do you mean?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.340
I'm worried about Bro.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.010
Domon! Domon! Domon!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.760
What's the big deal about him,
anyway?!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.720
We should just forget about him!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.230
That guy's put us through a lot!

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.020
I mean, if it isn't Master,
it's that Devil Gundam!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.770
He's always getting us into trouble!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.900
So, why are you still here?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.400
Me?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.650
I...

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.370
...just happen to have time.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:21.660
Why not?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.040
Why won't you take me to
Neo Hong Kong right away?

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:29.150
You know very well that you'll be
meeting Domon in the Finals.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:30.710
So it doesn't make sense
to abandon him.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:32.960
You sure change your mind a lot.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.470
Don't forget you're a prisoner!

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.510
Watch what you say!

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:40.930
Thanks for reminding me.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.640
However...

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.640
...the one holding us prisoner here...

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:48.520
...seems to be Domon Kasshu.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:19.880
Dad, I just couldn't do it.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.800
No matter how hard I tried,
I couldn't complete my training.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.010
Domon!

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.770
Domon!

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:27.730
What?

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.980
Is that Master's voice
ringing inside my head?

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.360
Domon!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.440
No, it isn't.

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.110
Whose voice could this be?!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.190
Come on! Come at me!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.950
I'm telling you to come at me!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.030
Just who are you?!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:42.280
Where are you hiding?!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:48.540
It's you!

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.370
Schwartz Bruder!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:52.750
Domon Kasshu!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.420
I challenge you to a...

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:58.920
...Gundam Fight!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.060
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.330
Ready...

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:13.020
Go!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:15.650
Wait!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.070
I don't intend to accept
this match!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.150
Quiet!

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:22.280
What's that guy thinking?!

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:28.660
How?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.670
How can he move so easily
in this place?!

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:38.670
If this keeps up...

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.220
Be prepared to perish!

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:46.890
Domon!
Have peace in your heart!

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.020
Die!

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.230
No!

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.640
I'm going to die.

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:54.840
This is the end!

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:00.690
What? What's this feeling?

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:02.840
Kyoji...

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:04.950
Dad, Mom...

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:06.470
Master...

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.640
It's all passing before me.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:12.750
I've let go of the
anger and hatred.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.170
All that's left is the end.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:19.540
Rain?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.050
I can see!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.890
Wh-what is this light?

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:41.150
What is it?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:46.950
It's shining!

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:49.030
This light from the crest!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.000
Something's happening to Bro.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.750
Wh-what's going on?

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.460
A serene state of mind.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:00.960
Listen.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.590
A clear heart without
ill feelings or guilt...

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:04.920
That is a serene state of mind.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.930
It gives one the ability to
surpass his own skills.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:11.390
And that's what activates
the Super Mode...

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:13.680
But why are you telling
your enemy this?!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.190
That's none of your concern!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.400
Just focus on developing
your techniques!

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.770
Use that power to
push back my Gundam!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:26.320
Once you're able to do that you
will have mastered your Super...

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:34.160
Wh-what's going on here?

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.630
The Death Army?!

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.990
And he was one step away...

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:51.110
Domon!

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:53.720
Leave these ones to me,
and get your Gundam!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:56.140
All right!
Rise!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:59.310
Gundam!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:06.570
It moved.
Domon must be calling the Gundam.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:11.990
But who's attacking?

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.000
The Death Army?!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:25.460
Domon Kasshu's Shining Gundam
is being targeted!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.380
Argo!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.130
Never mind them!
We have to escape...!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:28.800
Shut up!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.050
For the moment,
I will do what I must!

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:32.760
What?!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.180
Argo...

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:55.990
I can handle the Death Army!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:09.220
Mademoiselle.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:11.260
Are you okay?

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.640
Chibodee! George!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.140
I'm here, too!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.560
Okay, I'll keep the enemy
behind us at bay.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.570
Sis, hurry and get to
where Bro is!

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:27.570
Thank you!

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.490
Okay! Let's go!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.160
Now! Come at me!

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:45.460
Rain!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:46.590
Where is the Gundam headed?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.550
I'm not sure.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.720
But it's where Domon's
signal originated.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.630
Well, they're going to
make it tough for us.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.270
Scatter!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.450
Now they're using flying types?!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:15.990
I'll take care of those!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:19.370
Go!

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:21.750
Rose Bits!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:27.580
Easier than expected.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.260
Oh, no!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:39.640
George!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.600
Don't look back, Rain!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:44.560
But he...

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.690
Just keep your mouth shut
and watch in front of you!

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:57.070
What?!

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:05.250
Rain! Go around them!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:09.710
They're going all out.
They even brought in water troops.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:10.630
However...

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:15.380
...I've got to make sure Domon
gets his Gundam, no matter what.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:15.970
But...

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:17.840
Now, get going!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:20.300
Okay!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.020
Now! Come on!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.790
Burning Punch!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.500
Shoot!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.390
Ch-Chibodee...!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:03.390
Domon!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.560
Master! You're joking!

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:13.310
If it isn't Rain Mikamura.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:14.780
Oh, well.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.510
I'll gladly finish you off!

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:47.640
Rain!

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:00.450
Master!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:01.950
Domon!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.040
Do you think you can destroy me...

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.500
...with just that dull sword?

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.460
What?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.840
Don't make me laugh!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.220
That light I saw coming from you...

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:27.060
...I guess it was nothing, after all.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:30.850
Master!

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.060
Here in the spot
where I trained you...

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.690
...I will be sure to
bury you forever!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:44.660
You again!

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:51.460
Argo!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:56.380
No fun in going to Neo Hong
Kong if you aren't there.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.210
He's right.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:19:59.710
Hey, Bro...

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.590
...no more playing hide-and-seek,
okay?

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:06.890
Yeah. We weren't the only ones
waiting for you.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.770
Remember, there's one other
special person.

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:10.220
Yeah.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:17.770
Thank you.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:19.860
You little...!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:30.040
How dare you try to
make a fool out of me!

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.130
Argo! Are you okay?!

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.710
Master!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.010
Shut up!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.640
Well, Domon!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:52.560
It looks like today's the day we're
finally going to have to settle this!

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:58.190
What?

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:04.070
What's this?

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:11.830
I'm not letting any one of you
escape from here alive!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:16.080
But first I'll make you suffer here
in the Guyana Highlands!

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.750
Not so fast!

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.790
I'll cut a path out of here
with my sword!

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:20.840
Wait, Domon!

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:23.840
Don't do it!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:26.090
We'd all be wiser to unite
and get out of here!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:26.740
No!

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:28.680
I won't involve anyone else.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.470
This is my battle.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:34.430
Yes. This hand of mine shines
and roars with power!

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:37.770
Its bright cry tells me
to defeat my master!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.000
Glad to hear it!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.900
That's what I expect
from a former pupil!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.190
In that case...

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.280
...my ultimate!

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:45.780
No!

00:21:45.780 --> 00:21:47.110
You haven't completed
your training!

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.250
You fool!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.000
Domon!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.540
Master!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:01.750
Take this!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.800
Shining...

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.260
...Darkness...

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:09.010
...Finger!

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:32.660
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.030 --> 00:22:37.040
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:41.500
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:45.050
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:52.220
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:57.930
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:03.190
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:09.740
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.030 --> 00:23:19.870
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:35.300
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:35.300 --> 00:23:37.430
Land, air and sea!

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:40.940
The Devil Gundam's massive
army has blanketed the whole area!

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.230
There is no way out of the
Guyana Highlands now.

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:46.610
And now the team of
Gundam Fighters...

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:49.070
...begins a desperate battle
against the Army!

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:52.280
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.280 --> 00:23:56.780
Breakthrough!
Warriors' Strong Ties

00:23:54.280 --> 00:24:00.720
Breakthrough!
Warriors' Strong Ties

00:23:56.780 --> 00:23:59.120
Ready! Go!
